@quotation
@emph{Exercise 4.50a is added by this edition and extends exercise
4.50; SICP numbers stop at 4.50.} @strong{@anchor{Exercise 4.50a}Exercise 4.50a:} The
edition's @code{ramb} draws from a seeded generator: the evaluator holds a
seeded @code{xorshift64*} instance, created when the driver is constructed
(@code{Amb::new(AMB_SEED)}), and shuffles each @code{ramb}'s alternatives
with a Fisher--Yates pass over its draws -- no global generator anywhere.
Demonstrate the reproducibility this buys: two drivers from one seed must
ramble identically, and a driver from a different seed must ramble
differently.
